## Original Content
Власти Канады вводят с 8 сентября пошлины в размере 15%, 25% и 50% в отношении ряда товаров из США, говорится в заявлении министерства финансов Канады.

## Summary
Canada has announced retaliatory tariffs against the United States, effective September 8. The duties will be set at rates of 15%, 25%, and 50% on a range of American goods. The announcement was made by Canada's Ministry of Finance.

## Key Points
- Canada will impose retaliatory tariffs on US goods beginning September 8
- Tariff rates are set at three levels: 15%, 25%, and 50%
- The tariffs apply to a selected range of products imported from the United States
- The measure was officially announced by Canada's Ministry of Finance


